(IT SERVICES AGREEMENT No. 2026-047) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(This IT Services Agreement \(the "Agreement"\) is entered into on 3 November 2026 between) Tj T*
(Northwind Cloud Ltd., registered in Sofia, Bulgaria, company number 204551873 \(the "Supplier"\),) Tj T*
(and Brightline Retail AD, company number 175664213 \(the "Client"\).) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. Subject) Tj T*
(1.1. The Supplier shall provide hosting, monitoring and maintenance of the Client's e-commerce) Tj T*
(platform \(the "Services"\) as described in Annex 1.) Tj T*
(1.2. The Supplier may change the scope of the Services or the subcontractors used to provide) Tj T*
(them at its own discretion by notifying the Client by e-mail.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. Term and renewal) Tj T*
(2.1. This Agreement enters into force on 15 November 2026 and is concluded for an initial term) Tj T*
(of 24 months.) Tj T*
(2.2. The Agreement shall automatically renew for successive periods of 24 months unless either) Tj T*
(party gives written notice of non-renewal at least 120 days before the end of the current term.) Tj T*
(2.3. The Client may terminate this Agreement before the end of the term only upon payment of) Tj T*
(all fees remaining for the current term.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3. Fees and payment) Tj T*
(3.1. The Client shall pay a monthly fee of EUR 4,800 excluding VAT, invoiced in advance.) Tj T*
(3.2. Invoices are payable within 10 days of the invoice date.) Tj T*
(3.3. Late payments bear interest of 2% per month on the outstanding amount.) Tj T*
(3.4. The Supplier may increase the fees once per calendar year by notice to the Client.) Tj T*
ET
